// # Phys Classical -- Classical Mechanics, Fluids, Thermo, Rigid/Soft Body
//
// Logline: Classical mechanics, fluid dynamics, thermodynamics, rigid/soft body simulation, collisions. Partitioned into bounded subpackages <= 8 files.
//
// Setup: Co-located module with partitioned subpackages under std/science/phys/classical. Pure compute, no caps.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Conservation and least-action foundation family.
//   2. Thermo family (carnot, entropy, gibbs, ideal_gas).
//   3. Fluid dynamics and continuum family.
//   4. Collision, rigid body, soft body family.
//   5. Compressible flow, boundary layer, aerodynamic family.
//   6. Lattice Boltzmann, turbulence, RANS/LES family.
//   7. Acoustic wave, reverberation, Doppler family.
//   8. Orbital mechanics and celestial physics family.

import "physics.oo";
import "physics_advanced.oo";
import "physics_advanced_stubs.oo";
import "physics_stubs.oo";
import "fluid/anchor.oo";
import "aero/anchor.oo";
import "thermo/anchor.oo";
import "rigid/anchor.oo";
import "soft/anchor.oo";
import "ragdoll/anchor.oo";
import "collision/anchor.oo";
import "orbital/anchor.oo";
import "acoustic/anchor.oo";
import "integrators/anchor.oo";
import "foundation/anchor.oo";
